=================
ans.com
=================
* Com -- ANS

The acceptable use policy for ANS, a nonprofit corporation dedicated
to the advancement of research and education.  The policy identifies
the furtherance of education and research as the primary for the
existence of computer services.  The policy also prohibits system
disruptions, "highly offensive" messages, and commercial uses.


=================
baylor.edu.critique
=================
* Edu -- Baylor U. -- Critique

Critique of the Computer Polices of Baylor Univeristy. It says in part:

'The school's written policy isn't bad ... The Baylor ... could be
improved by allowing "personal use." ... The Baylor policy also
provides for some due process, although the "due process" begins by
temporarily suspending a user from the computer.'

