ndsu.edu
=================
* Edu -- North Dakota State U

North Dokota State University policy on misues of computer facilities.

In summary: Responsible computer use means files, passwords, and
output are private; no offensive material shall be entered or sent; no
unauthorized copies shall be made; no unauthorized commercial use
shall be made; violators shall be disciplined.

=================
netnews.iastate.edu.critique
=================
* Edu -- Iowa State U. -- Netnews -- Critique

Critique of the Netnews policy that took effect at Iowa State
University in January, 1992. The policy has been updated, but
most of the critique still applies.

Summary: The policy is bans virtually all discussions of sex. This ban
is unnecessary and an affront in the intellectual and academic freedom
of the the students and faculty. The policy should be changed to
better respect intellectual freedom by more accurately reflecting
library policy (and the law).

