=================
* Edu -- U. of Pennsylvania -- SEAS -- Critique - old

A critique of the old policy for the main timesharing system for
the School of Engineering and Applied Science (SEAS) at the University
of Pennsylvania. 

Summary: Privacy protection is vague. Due process protections are weak
and vague. Some of the wording is awkward, confusing, and redundant.
Does not acknowledge general University policies (if any) on free
expression and privacy.

