ontario.gov.ca.critique
=================
* Government -- Ontario, Canada -- Critique

This is a critique of a framework by the government of Ontario for
university speech codes. The framework ends the universities' academic
freedom right to operate autonomously from the Ontario government. The
framework also ends the students' and professors' academic freedom
rights free expression by defining all most all offensive speech as
harassment.

