=================
psu.edu
=================
* Edu -- Penn. State U.

POLICY STATEMENT ON COMPUTER AND SOFTWARE MISUSE

This is part of the Pennsylvania State University Code. It is from
the document '//psuinfo/Policies-Rules for Students/Policies and
Rules/Computer And Software Misuse'. It is available via gopher from
info.psu.edu.

(See the /statements directory of the CAF archive directory for other
portions of the PSU University code.)

It states in part that, "It is a violation of University regulations
to...intentionally and without authorization...interfere with the
operation of...any computer, ...computer program, or computer data base."

It further states that "These regulations may also apply to computer
equipment and data belonging to...members of the University community
...when violations are deemed to have a substantial adverse effect upon
the University community or upon individual members of the University
community."

