* Canada -- U. Toronto -- Scarborough C. -- Critique

Two critiques of the acceptable use policy for the Scarborough College
campus of the University of Toronto.  Both are extremely critical.
One refers to it as the "policy from hell."  The other summarizes
his own critique:

"A critique of the U. of Toronto (Scarborough) computer
policy. It is perhaps the worst computer policy that I have every
read [...]. By its own terms, this policy violates itself. It is
vague, contradictory, and in violation of all most all principles of
academic freedom. It should be revoke[d]."


