=================
sexual-harassment.uiuc.edu
=================
* Edu -- U. of Illinois at U-C -- Sexual Harassment

This is an official policy recommendation for dealing with sexual
harassment in computing labs of the Engineering College of the
University of Illinois. It tries to fight harassment while not going
to the extreme of banning mere possession or private display of
sexually explicit material. In extensive on-line discussion, many
criticized the recommendation as still being too broad and vague.
Archives of much of that discussion are available in files:
batch/jul_04_1993, batch/jul_11_1993, and batch/jul_18_1993.

